{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THIS IS AN EARLY TEST BUILD WITH LIMITED CONTENT TO GATHER FEEDBACK. THANK YOU!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/5bedd1c4464ec4a590f663937f1e55d0.poster.avif?t=1760837466\" width=960 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/5bedd1c4464ec4a590f663937f1e55d0.webm?t=1760837466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/5bedd1c4464ec4a590f663937f1e55d0.mp4?t=1760837466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Holy monsters are furiously attacking Hell!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God damn! The holy monsters have decided to destroy Hell again! Under the command of a demon (that's you!), the four remaining circles must build the economy and defense of the settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The process is divided into rounds consisting of growth and defence stages. With each round, the forces of light attack more fiercely, bringing new misfortunes to the inhabitants and infrastructure of Hell. I will provide starting demons and resources. I won't provide the recipe for victory. CAN YOU HANDLE IT?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/668008dc110a88f1471dab23e7bf118b.poster.avif?t=1760837466\" width=960 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/668008dc110a88f1471dab23e7bf118b.webm?t=1760837466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/668008dc110a88f1471dab23e7bf118b.mp4?t=1760837466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seven deadly sins...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The infrastructure of Hell is organized around the deadly sins. &quot;Sloth&quot; is responsible for production, while &quot;lust&quot; is responsible for reproduction. And So On! There are various resources, but the main one is sinners with their stories and crimes. The script sends them straight to Hell. You will have to catch them and process them, extracting sin and fragments of the soul or creating new demons using them. As you progress in the game, you will move down to new circles. It's darker down there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/c1fed7456d4b9cbe576292709cc791ee.poster.avif?t=1760837466\" width=960 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/c1fed7456d4b9cbe576292709cc791ee.webm?t=1760837466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/c1fed7456d4b9cbe576292709cc791ee.mp4?t=1760837466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>What\u2019s the roguelike aspect?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do the holy invaders want? To destroy the Heart of Darkness (the main building). If it falls, you will have to start everything over. Almost everything. Sin (experience) is spent on learning skills and unlocking new buildings. This knowledge is not lost, meaning you become stronger with each session.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/3ff6d06483a67790dbfeed340f7070a8.poster.avif?t=1760837466\" width=960 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/3ff6d06483a67790dbfeed340f7070a8.webm?t=1760837466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/3ff6d06483a67790dbfeed340f7070a8.mp4?t=1760837466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>What\u2019s the plot?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, traders or random famous sinners will visit the settlement. They'll explain why you were chosen to manage such a difficult task. Occasionally, particularly strong righteous beings (bosses?) will attack. They will also have something to say.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834300?t=1760837466","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/9d8c9cdc76386e3e1afe4aa4b9313e85b327c6ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760837466","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/2f08df84a5ac7cf77e4bd7913dbc09f6aa2ad5a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760837466","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/2f08df84a5ac7cf77e4bd7913dbc09f6aa2ad5a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760837466","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THIS IS AN EARLY TEST BUILD WITH LIMITED CONTENT TO GATHER FEEDBACK. THANK YOU!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834300/extras/5bedd1c4464ec4a590f663937f1e55d0.poster.avif?t=1760837466\" width=960 height=262 ><source src=\"h